# dist is committed deliberately: src/main.py's StaticFiles mount (/demo)
# serves it same-origin, and Vercel's Python build doesn't run an npm build
# step for it. Rebuild with `npx vite build` (base=/demo/ in production
# mode, per vite.config.ts) and commit whenever frontend/src changes.
